    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="1502" n="1344" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1344"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Chargé to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic">April 6,
                        1906</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: Supplementing my oral
                    communications on the same subject, I have the honor to inform your excellency
                    that the foreign envoys extraordinary to the forthcoming wedding of His Majesty
                    the King of Spain, my august sovereign, which is to take place during the month
                    of June next, will, during their stay at the court, be the guests of His
                    Majesty’s Government.</p>
                <p>I am glad to communicate the foregoing to your excellency, and avail myself,
                    etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">L. Pastor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
